# Team: We can fix him / Are we the bad guys? — Game Writing Document

## Premise
- Alien invades sci‑fi facility, kills/maims many  
- Alien is almost defeated, is weakened  
- Alien attaches to a human it almost killed  
  - Symbiotic relationship: alien keeps human alive until alien gets stronger  
- Character interactions and choices between alien and human

## Game story introduction
- Aliens need the McGuffin  
- Human protagonist steals the McGuffin  
- Alien protagonist bounty-hunts the human protagonist  
- Something causes Alien & Human to team up  
- Something causes alien race & human race to unite against the protagonists (probably the McGuffin)  
- (undecided events)  
- Ending reached

## Choices & Endings

### Ending Variables
- Strength (S)
  - Equal strength  
  - Unequal strength
    - Human is stronger
    - Alien is stronger
- Romance (R)
  - None
  - Low
  - Medium
  - High

### Possible Endings (in order of specificity)
- True End
  - Equal S
  - High R
- Pet End
  - Pet End A
    - Human S higher
    - High R
  - Pet End B
    - Alien S higher
    - High R
- Bad End
  - Bad End A
    - Human S higher
    - No R
  - Bad End B
    - Alien S higher
    - No R
- Duel End
  - Equal S
  - No R
- Neutral End
  - Anything not contained in the former
